 ["are"]}]}, {"ma": "B", "ten": "Điền tên món đồ", "cau_hoi": [{"so": 6, "de": "I put them on my feet: ____.", "dap_an": "shoes", "nhan": ["shoes"]}, {"so": 7, "de": "I put it on my head: a ____.", "dap_an": "hat", "nhan": ["hat"]}, {"so": 8, "de": "A girl can wear it. It is like a long shirt: a ____.", "dap_an": "dress", "nhan": ["dress"]}, {"so": 9, "de": "It is cold, so I wear a ____.", "dap_an": "coat", "nhan": ["coat"]}]}]}